Z||000000||Fiero_24||11-06-2001||02:47 PM||||I ordered a set of poly bushings from the Fiero Store last Wed for a 2 day shipping.  I had problems getting through to the Fiero Store until today, so I got the tracking #.  UPS dropped off my stuff Friday at 1250 Morse Ave.  The address it was going to was 1200 Claremont.  Do you see the similarity?  What idiots!!!  I hate UPS and I think they should wake up!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driverside41.jpg"> <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
