Z||000002||fierospeeder||11-06-2001||05:35 PM||||I love the US mail.  cause its patriotic.<P>UPS seems to expensive.  It might be cause i use to go to a ma and pop store and their prices were a tad high.<P>If everyone used the us mail, the stamp prices probably wouldn't be raised.<P>The mail does get to me quick, and my packages from ebay, when USPO is chosen, arrives in the reasonable length of time.<P>The only thing that the us mail sucks, is sometimes they ruin my front cover of my car magazines, which is seldom.||||reg||1
